<% content_for :title, 'How Ora works' %><section class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span><h1>From “someday”<br>to <em>your next step.</em></h1><p>Six simple steps, and a real person beside you for every one of them.</p></section><section class="section how-grid"><% [['01', 'Find your treatment', 'See real prices from trusted clinics, at your own pace.'], ['02', 'Pick your clinic', 'Compare who offers it, where they are, and what they charge.'], ['03', 'Start your care journey', 'A few quick questions. No paperwork, no pressure.'], ['04', 'Choose how to pay', 'Pay the clinic at once, or small, small every month. Monthly plans are reviewed by our financing partners.'], ['05', 'Meet your clinician', 'They confirm what’s right for you, and your final price, before anything is agreed.'], ['06', 'Get treated, and keep track', 'Your plan, dates and updates live in My Care, and we check in after.']].each do |n, title, desc| %><article><span class="how-number"><%= n %></span><h3><%= title %></h3><p><%= desc %></p></article><% end %></section><section class="closing-cta"><span class="eyebrow">READY WHEN YOU ARE</span><h2>That thing you keep postponing? Let’s start.</h2><%= link_to 'Find my treatment', procedures_path, class: 'button primary' %></section>
